Description: themes for Openbox
 This package contains the default themes for Openbox.

Package: openbox-portal
Architecture: any
Depends:
    openbox (= ${binary:Version}),
    ${misc:Depends},
    xdg-desktop-portal
Description: xdg-desktop-portal backend for Openbox
 This package provides portal implementations for sandboxed applications
 running under Openbox, including Settings, Screenshot, and Background portals.
